Migrations for the ELN database.

    alembic upgrade head          apply everything outstanding
    alembic current               what this database is at
    alembic history               what exists
    alembic upgrade head --sql    print the SQL instead of running it

Run them as a role that can create roles and change ownership — not as
eln_app, which deliberately cannot. Set ELN_MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL if that is
a different connection from the application's.

For a database that already has the schema (provisioned before migrations, or
applied by hand), mark it as current instead of re-running:

    alembic stamp 0001_initial_schema

The schema's source of truth is ../../docs/*.sql. Revision 0001 applies those
four files; every revision after it is hand-written. Do not trust
`--autogenerate` — see the note at the top of env.py.
